        "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:09:51.023Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We are aware that some of you experienced interruptions due to a VM load update during the exam. To ensure fairness, we extended the exam time for everyone by more than the time lost. The  most students were still able to successfully complete the exam within the adjusted timeframe.</p>\n<p>Please note that a re-oppe is only available for students who did not pass the exam. Since you have successfully passed, our policy does not allow us to grant you a re-oppe.</p>",
