      "created_at": "2025-08-20T23:38:35.276Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello Sir/Madam,</p>\n<p>I am writing to inform you about the difficulties I faced during the OPPE exam.<br>\nInitially, I had mailed my issue to the DS Support team, but they advised me to post here on Discourse so that the concerned instructors can review it.</p>\n<p>During the exam, for after <strong>50 minutes till last,</strong> I was facing problems while typing and running commands in the VM. The commands were either not typed correctly or not executing properly despite trying multiple times. Because of this, I lost a lot of exam time and could not proceed smoothly. i told instructor many times to have to check , i think you have to gave an another chance for oppe on 23rd august</p>\n<p>Kindly look into this issue and guide me on what can be done regarding my case and respnd me as early as possible</p>",
